      "content": "i see. it just feels like a lot of the arguments for these regs focused on long-term benefits seem to ignore that immediate reality for local businesses. is there any real evidence that the \"long-term innovation\" or environmental benefits actually outweigh the risk of these smaller companies shutting down?",
